# Conformance probe pack for a switch key whose line fails its transform on
# decode (spec 0.20, ruling 35), most significant bit first. Public.
#
#   label : 8 uint via tbl (1 alpha), then by label
#     alpha  x : 8
#     (no else)
#
# A wire value with no table entry fails the decode with transform-decode
# (ruling 4 of 0.6, ruling 9 of 0.1.1), not no-kind.
format     conformance-kinds-fail
version    0.20.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
map    tbl  1  alpha
field  probe.label  8  uint  via tbl
switch probe.label
  case alpha
    field  probe.x  8  uint
end
